{"id":"n66571-1-9","stage":2,"title":"얹다 · 放","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66571-1-9-1","ko":"커피 위에 뭘 얹은 거야?","zh":"咖啡上加了什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"커피","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"3","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위에","audio":"/audio/045b71d3898d7969a90d.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"얹은","meaning":"添加","explanation":"얹다：添加；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"얹다","audio":"/audio/2845647871b4e2066df8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66571","senseId":"3","lemma":"얹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얹은","audio":"/audio/2c1386eecd6d381c053f.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，把前面的修饰内容概括为事物、行为或情况。这里不表示指示代词“那个”；具体的时态、疑问或推测语气结合前后的语尾理解。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"71462","definition":"某东西的表面或平坦的表面。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"2845647871b4e206","term":"얹다","zh":"添加","audio":"/audio/2845647871b4e2066df8.mp3","entryId":"66571","definition":"在一定的量或额数上再追加少量。","pronunciation":["언따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/1bdf972735a73f9574fd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66571-1-9-2","ko":"생크림을 좀 얹어 봤지. 맛있겠지?","zh":"加了点鲜奶油，看着好喝吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"생크림을","meaning":"生奶油，鲜奶油","explanation":"생크림：生奶油，鲜奶油；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생크림","audio":"/audio/7af75ba86ee09992f6d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62245","senseId":"1","lemma":"생크림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생크림을","audio":"/audio/de73a85bb66a1c4c3b68.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"얹어","meaning":"添加","explanation":"얹다：添加；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"얹다","audio":"/audio/2845647871b4e2066df8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66571","senseId":"3","lemma":"얹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얹어","audio":"/audio/1e7951327712709e2538.mp3"}},{"text":"봤지.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","sen